config WORD_MEMCPY
	bool "memcpy and memmove that store whole words at any alignment"
	help
	  Replaces the C library's memcpy and memmove with ones that copy words
	  also when source and destination are aligned differently within a
	  word, where picolibc copies bytes. For a CPU whose every store goes to
	  slow memory, a Sapphire SoC with a write-through data cache running
	  from HyperRAM.
